<div id="Sx1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Data availability: The data that support the findings of this study are openly available at <a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/lawful-good-project/sud-resh-benchmark" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://huggingface.co/datasets/lawful-good-project/sud-resh-benchmark</a> and in <a href="https://github.com/TryDotAtwo/TestEvalForLaw" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/TryDotAtwo/TestEvalForLaw</a>.</p>
